Route32_EventScript_YoungsterGordon::
	trainerbattle_single TRAINER_GORDON Route32_Text_YoungsterGordon_Seen, Route32_Text_YoungsterGordon_Beaten
	msgbox Route32_Text_YoungsterGordon_After, MSGBOX_AUTOCLOSE
